dem-minified.gls -- dem-minified.json

The file: one line of 5.4 MB of minified JSON, {"k0":[1,2.5,"café
中文",{"x":null}],"k1":...,"end":true}, with 2-byte and wide characters.

Open:   chezweb dem-minified.json

1. C-e  C-a              Expect: the end and the start of the first row
                         shown, at once.
2. C-f C-f C-f  C-b C-b  Expect: one character each, at once.
3. x                     Expect: typed, at once.
4. M->                   Expect: the end of the line, "end":true}, within
                         0.5 s.
5. C-p C-p C-n           Expect: row by row, at once; the cursor never
                         below the last row of the window.
6. Click with the mouse on three places of the text
                         Expect: the cursor where you click, at once.
7. On the bottom row: C-e then the right arrow, several times
                         Expect: the window scrolls a row each time, the
                         cursor stays on the text, never on the mode line.
8. Still deep in the line, where step 7 left you: type the letter y
   (it is inserted, as x was in step 3), then C-a, then click on some
   text, then C-e.
                         Expect: each at once, though the cursor is
                         megabytes into a single line.
9. M-<                   Expect: at once.
10. C-x k RET, then "y": do not save.
